# 根构建上下文仅允许 PWA 构建输入，避免带入凭据、日志和其他项目。
**
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.npmrc
!pwa/
!pwa/**
!pi-extension/
!pi-extension/package.json
!pi-extension/install.sh
!packages/
!packages/protocol/
!packages/protocol/package.json
!packages/protocol/tsconfig.json
!packages/protocol/src/
!packages/protocol/src/**

**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.vite/
**/dist/
**/.vitest/
**/out/
**/coverage/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
**/.pi/
**/.env*
**/.git/
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.test.*
**/*.node.test.*
**/*.browser.test.*
**/.DS_Store
pwa/public/sw.js
pwa/public/sw.js.map
